    <section id="about" class="fade">
      <div class="section-head">
        <span class="num mono">01.</span><h2 data-en="About" data-id="Tentang">About</h2><span class="rule"></span>
      </div>
      <div class="about-grid">
        <div>
          <p data-en="Hello! My name is Pedro, and I enjoy turning messy data into decisions people can act on. I graduated in Information Systems from UIN Sultan Syarif Kasim Riau in 7 semesters, with a GPA of 3.71 out of 4.00." data-id="Halo! Nama saya Pedro, dan saya senang mengubah data yang berantakan menjadi keputusan yang bisa ditindaklanjuti. Saya lulus dari Program Studi Sistem Informasi UIN Sultan Syarif Kasim Riau dalam 7 semester, dengan IPK 3.71 dari 4.00.">
            Hello! My name is Pedro, and I enjoy turning messy data into decisions
            people can act on. I graduated in Information Systems from UIN Sultan
